{emailSubject}{if $accepted}Solution accepted{else}Solution acceptance removed{/if}{/emailSubject}
<h1>Solution #{$attempt} of '{$assignment}' assignment {if $accepted}was marked as accepted{else}had its accepted flag removed{/if}</h1>

<table role="presentation" class="facts" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Group</td>
        <td class="v">{$group}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Assignment</td>
        <td class="v">{$assignment}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Solution</td>
        <td class="v">#{$attempt} of {$attempts}, submitted at {$submittedAt|localizedDate:'en'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Points for the assignment</td>
        <td class="v">{$points}{if $maxPoints} out of {$maxPoints}{/if}</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<p n:if="$prevAttempt">
    The newly accepted solution replaced previously accepted solution #{$prevAttempt}
    (submitted at {$prevSubmittedAt|localizedDate:'en'}).
</p>

<p n:if="$accepted">
    Accepted solutions suppresses the results of other solutions, so the scored points for the
    assignment will not change even if you submit another solution.
</p>

{button($link, 'Open the solution')|noescape}
